      "put": {
        "description": "The body is the whole set of rules and every field is required (a field left out is a 422): an empty list, 0 or false sets no rule, so an empty reviewers list removes them and the jobs that wait for a review are released. An environment whose name differs only in case is the same environment and keeps its name. Every change is recorded in the audit log. Only a person's own credential changes the rules: a request under sudo, with an OAuth2 grant or with an authorized integration is a 403. An unknown reviewer, or one the caller can't see, is a 422; so is an invalid rule.\n",
